📄 Screen Flow Document – Golden 1 Website
Application URL: https://www.golden1.com/

1. Home Page
· User opens the Golden 1 website.
· The homepage loads with:
· Logo
· Top navigation menu
· Login / Open Account options
· Main banner (hero section)

2. Top Navigation Menu
· User can see the main menu options:
· Personal
· Business
· Financial Wellness
· Appointments
· Locations
· Help Center

3. Navigate to a Main Menu Section
· User clicks on any top menu option (e.g., Personal).
· The corresponding section page loads.

4. Submenu Navigation
· After clicking a main menu:
· Submenu options are displayed.
· User selects a submenu item (e.g., Checking, Savings, Loans).
· The related page opens.

5. Page Content Display
· The selected page shows:
· Page heading
· Section content
· Product or service information

6. Utility Actions
User can also:
· Click Log In to access online banking
· Click Open Account
· Use search feature (if available)

7. Footer Section
· At the bottom of any page, user sees:
· Contact information
· Privacy policy
· Terms and other links

